## Reviewer points not applied
- a#11 著作權. The gloss is the right Traditional Chinese for copyright. Adding it only in Bengali makes the four-language disclosure test fail, because every locale must annotate the same CJK set. It was not added, and the test was not edited for this.
- a#13 and a#23 lakh/crore grouping, including TWD 15,70,000 for the pinned bio figure. The checker parses bn amounts only with a Western comma. ACCEPTED-ROUND says the same. TWD 1.57M stays byte-identical.
- a#12’s suggested “নিম্ন আদালত থেকে প্রথম রায়” drops the pinned figure. The bio now says প্রথম আদালত থেকে TWD 1.57M রায়.
- a#16’s list of English firm names. ACCEPTED keeps those proper names in Latin. The degree line is translated with the English name left in parentheses.
- a#30 and b#32: deleting U+200B, or promoting Q16–Q20 to headings, fails the block check. The visible sign-off was rephrased; the invisible characters stayed.
- a#37: deleting the difficulty row changes the table. The cells were rewritten so they do not say the claim is easy.
- b#15 উপশাখা. R8’s 分支機構 is a branch establishment, not a sub-branch of a 分公司.
- b#28: merging the 013/015 fragments changes the block count. Each paragraph was completed in place.
- b#36 ঢাকা. That is “covered”. The overwrite sentence says the new recording replaces the old footage.
- মুনাফা-অন্বেষী উদ্যোগ, treaty উদ্যোগ মুনাফা, and বিনিয়োগ উদ্যোগ in the permit title. Those are 營利事業 / enterprise profits / 投資事業, not the “initiative” calque the verdict named.
